SUMMARY:Philadelphia Horticultural Society’s Bouquet of Stories (through 
 Jan 30)
LOCATION:Athenaeum of Philadelphia\, 219 S. 6th St.\, PA
DESCRIPTION:PHS and The Athenaeum of Philadelphia are bringing three centur
 ies of Philadelphia’s gardening history to life with a new free exhibiti
 on opening November 6. “Bouquet of Stories: Celebrating Philadelphia’s
  Gardening Heritage” explores the growers\, communities and traditions t
 hat have shaped Philadelphia\, from immigrant seed traditions and neighbor
 hood greening to the Philadelphia Flower Show. Plus a new garden “of fra
 grance and calm” designed by award-winning landscape designer Wambui Ipp
 olito.…\n\nEvent website: https://philaathenaeum.org/\n\nListing: https:
 //countylinesmagazine.com/event/philadelphia-horticultural-societys-bouque
 t-of-stories/
